  "title": "Brandywine Realty Trust Announces Common Quarterly Dividend, and Confirms First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "PHILADELPHIA, Feb. 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Brandywine Realty Trust (NYSE:BDN) announced today that its Board of Trustees has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.08 per common share and OP Unit payable on April 16, 2026 to holders of record on April 2, 2026.",
